{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TRI-GER is a vector based top down shoot-em-up inspired by classic arcade games. With your ability to switch colors and upgrade your arsenal, your job is to fight endless waves of multi-color enemy insectoids and maximize your high score. Match the color of your blaster with the enemies you're shooting to increase your damage and rack up combos, but be careful! Color matching is a two way street, so enemies that share your color have the same advantages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697010/extras/261d498af2a85439854d6cd94fb3587b.poster.avif?t=1761862285\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697010/extras/261d498af2a85439854d6cd94fb3587b.webm?t=1761862285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697010/extras/261d498af2a85439854d6cd94fb3587b.mp4?t=1761862285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br><br>Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between 3 colors to maximize damage dealt to enemy insectoids</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697010/extras/9c73e62e3296afd305c309b72e44066a.poster.avif?t=1761862285\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697010/extras/9c73e62e3296afd305c309b72e44066a.webm?t=1761862285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697010/extras/9c73e62e3296afd305c309b72e44066a.mp4?t=1761862285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"